      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783496420345,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REST API Endpoints\n\n- Request: POST /v1/files\n  BODY: Form Data\n        [ file ]\n \n- Request: GET /v1/files/:fileId\n  Response: file",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "REST API Endpoints\n\n- Request: POST /v1/files\n  BODY: Form Data\n        [ file ]\n \n- Request: GET /v1/files/:fileId\n  Response: file",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LzYQGAGCzSLARwRWqXYGy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 605.25,
      "y": 102,
      "width": 693,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1668077965,
      "version": 836,
      "versionNonce": 1042725165,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783497996263,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- User should be able to store the files (imgs, videos, etc)\n- User should be able to share the files\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n- Scale to 100M DAU & 1B files [to be confirmed by interviewer]\n- Fast access to files\n- Handlling large files\n- Files should be accessable only to people to whom its shared",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- User should be able to store the files (imgs, videos, etc)\n- User should be able to share the files\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n- Scale to 100M DAU & 1B files [to be confirmed by interviewer]\n- Fast access to files\n- Handlling large files\n- Files should be accessable only to people to whom its shared",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
