      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "100M DAU | 1B file\nRead heavy\n\n10^8 / 10^5 = 10^3 ~ 1k \n5 * 1k = 5k rps (consider the traffic is even)\n500k rps (system should be able to handle)",
      "autoResize": true,
